OL,3,GNEWSAE-motorbike killer's jail sentence
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rider of an illegal e-motorbike who
OL,7,Fknocked down and killed an 86-year-old
OL,8,Fgrandmother has had his "unduly
OL,9,Flenient" jail term increased by almost
OL,10,Ftwo years.
OL,12,FBilly Stokoe, then 18, had taken
OL,13,Fcannabis and was using a mobile phone
OL,14,Fwhen he hit Gloria Stephenson on a
OL,15,Fzebra crossing in Sunderland last year,
OL,16,Fthen rode off.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
