OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAE-motorbike killer's jail sentence
OL,4,Aincreased
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May he admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving and was sentenced to
OL,8,Fsix years and nine months but, after a
OL,9,Freferral by the solicitor general,
OL,10,Fjudges at the Court of Appeal raised it
OL,11,Fto eight years and six months.
OL,13,FJulie Francis, one of the victim's
OL,14,Fdaughters, said the decision would not
OL,15,F"bring our mum back" but "I feel like
OL,16,Fas a family we've been listened to".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
